00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:13.388
Dad.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.243
They're back.

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:41.541
<i>Cities across the Eastern Seaboard
are coming under attack.</i>

00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:44.043
<i>The CDC is warning
to stay in your homes</i>

00:00:44.127 --> 00:00:47.088
<i>and avoid contact with these
creatures at all cost.</i>

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:52.218
<i>I'm sure this is all going to be
over soon. I promise.</i>

00:00:52.594 --> 00:00:56.181
<i>Entire regions of the country
are being wiped off the map.</i>

00:00:57.974 --> 00:00:59.976 position:59%
It's like we're back in the Dark Ages.

00:01:02.645 --> 00:01:04.230
People are surviving.

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:09.944
We can't trust anyone now.

